  "details": "# Issue:\n\nDouble Clicking on the Avatars Tab button now brings you to the Search Tab for Avatars. This is similar to how the World and Social Tabs do it.\n\nThere is one difference though, the World and Social Tabs both have Tooltips telling you about it. This is currently missing from the Avatars Tab button.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:  \n\nThe tooltip for the Avatars Tab button should inform the player about it's double clicking function.\n\n\"Avatars. Double click to search Avatars\"\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nThe first two pictures show how the World and Social Tabs do it and the last one shows it missing from the Avatars Tab.",
